<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Huntco downgraded by DLJ.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Huntco downgraded by DLJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette said Tuesday it downgraded its rating on shares of Huntco Inc to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Steve Morrison said there was some concern the company's margins could come under renewed pressure.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 9/16 to 13-7/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
</text>
